OL,3,GNEWSACyclists' campaign to fix the
OL,4,Agender pedal gap
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners say more needs to be done
OL,7,Fto encourage women to take up cycling.
OL,9,FThe Gender Pedal Gap Taskforce, an
OL,10,Finitiative set up in Milton Keynes,
OL,11,Fsaid only one in four of the bikers
OL,12,Fthey surveyed on the city's cycle
OL,13,Froutes were women.
OL,15,FConcerns about safety and a lack of
OL,16,Ftime for leisure activities are
OL,17,Fbelieved to be among the reasons for
OL,18,Fthe disparity.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
